      "username": "anee",
      "name": null,
      "created_at": "2026-01-22T19:06:08.397Z",
      "cooked": "<p>In v16, the Print button is inside the sidebar. When we disable/collapse the sidebar, it only hides the labels/text, but the sidebar space still remains — so the form width doesn’t expand and we lose usable screen area.</p>",
